license: CC0-1.0
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Research scripts and selected saved simulation outputs accompanying two studies:
  Bayesian kernel machine regression sensitivity to data distribution and
  simulation-calibrated dynamic posterior inclusion probability thresholds.
  Key numerical summaries have been checked against saved outputs, but
  full historical MCMC workflows have not been independently rerun.
